    {
      "id": "note-1",
      "kind": "note",
      "stage": "implementation",
      "title": "Overview",
      "body": "\nA local, browser-based surface for reading a plan and **commenting on it**,\nlaunched from the CLI with `grogu review <plan-id>`.\n\n",
      "attrs": {
        "source": "markdown-import",
        "source_end": 146,
        "source_start": 15
      },
      "order": 1000,
      "created_rev": "r0001",
      "updated_rev": "r0001",
      "body_state": "full"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-2",
      "kind": "note",
      "stage": "implementation",
      "title": "Invariants",
      "body": "\n- **I1.** Markdown is *canonical*. The workspace never writes a stage body.\n- **I2.** Every stage read goes through `PlanStore.read_stage`.\n\n",
      "attrs": {
        "source": "markdown-import",
        "source_end": 302,
        "source_start": 160
      },
      "order": 2000,
      "created_rev": "r0001",
      "updated_rev": "r0001",
      "body_state": "full"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-3",
      "kind": "note",
      "stage": "implementation",
      "title": "The pipeline",
      "body": "\n```mermaid\nflowchart LR\n  Parse[Parse the plan] --> Render[Render HTML]\n  Render --> Anchor[Anchor comments]\n  Parse -->|retry| Parse\n  subgraph Server\n    Render\n    Anchor\n  end\n```\n\n",
      "attrs": {
        "source": "markdown-import",
        "source_end": 504,
        "source_start": 318
      },
      "order": 3000,
      "created_rev": "r0001",
      "updated_rev": "r0001",
      "body_state": "full"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-4",
      "kind": "note",
      "stage": "implementation",
      "title": "A table",
      "body": "\n| Stage | Reader |\n| --- | --- |\n| design | everyone |\n| testing | tester only |\n\nInline `code`, **strong**, *emphasis*, a [link](https://example.com), and an\nautolink <https://grogu.example> all render. An image ![alt](x.png) becomes a\nlink chip, never an `<img>`.\n\n> A block quote, for good measure.\n\n- one\n- two\n  - nested\n",
      "attrs": {
        "source": "markdown-import",
        "source_end": 842,
        "source_start": 515
      },
      "order": 4000,
      "created_rev": "r0001",
      "updated_rev": "r0001",
